Description:
    Generates a series.yml file for a new event series, like a conference or a meetup group.
    Use --parent to nest the series in another one, like a local Rails Girls chapter in Rails Girls.

Example:
    bin/rails generate series --series=lrug --name="London Ruby User Group" --kind=meetup \
      --location="London, United Kingdom" --timezone=Europe/London --meetup=https://www.meetup.com/lrug

    This will create:
        data/lrug/series.yml

  Create a series nested in another series.
    bin/rails generate series --series=rails-girls-bern --name="Rails Girls Bern" --kind=workshop --parent=rails-girls

    This will create:
        data/rails-girls/rails-girls-bern/series.yml
